## Tanstack Start (React)

- Avoid large jsx blocks for react components and create smaller components
- Avoid `useEffect` unless needed

## Tailwind

- Always use v4

## Shadcn

- Shadcn components can be found in `/src/components/ui`. You can use the shadcn mcp to find an install new components

